   "data": {
    "bull": [
     {
      "text": "The company delivers strong profitability with ROCE of 26%, operating margin of 18.8% (up from 18.2% three years ago), low leverage (debt-to-equity 0.21), and operating cash flow covering PAT 1.29x over three years.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "The June 2026 quarter showed peak recent performance with revenue of ₹10,542 Cr and PAT of ₹1,559 Cr, well above the other three quarters in the trailing twelve months.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Management guides for 8-10% volume growth in FY27, a sustained 3-4% price growth trajectory, and a ₹3,250 Cr CapEx program for GenNext emulsion expected to reach full capacity within a year.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2026-08-01:p20",
       "T:2026-06-01:p26",
       "T:2026-11-01:p13"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "bear": [
     {
      "text": "Three-year CAGR remains muted at 1% for revenue and 1.6% for PAT, indicating structural growth stagnation despite scale.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Quarterly earnings are volatile: PAT fell 30% sequentially from ₹1,559 Cr in June 2026 to ₹1,085 Cr in September 2026, with revenue also declining 5% over the same period.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Key forward-looking targets — volume growth of 8-10%, margin band of 41-43%, price growth of 3-4%, and GenNext emulsion ramp-up — have not yet been verified against reported financials, creating execution uncertainty.",
